1
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,190
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:46,950
[Episode 8]

3
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:47,430
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,210
[ZYA invites you to video call]

6
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,360
What's up?

7
00:01:11,850 --> 00:01:14,530
♪ Under cloudy skies, I look up ♪

8
00:01:14,890 --> 00:01:18,180
♪ Numbness is enough ♪

9
00:01:18,570 --> 00:01:26,539
[Microphone: ON][Speaker: ON][Camera: ON]

10
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:23,440
♪ I don't ask for fairy-tale scenes ♪

11
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:22,520
Did I wake you?

12
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:24,160
No.

13
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,520
I haven't slept yet.

14
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:26,400
What is it?

15
00:01:26,350 --> 00:01:31,820
♪ Too many lies greet me along the way ♪

16
00:01:27,789 --> 00:01:28,560
Sorry.

17
00:01:31,370 --> 00:01:32,840
I haven't thought of an excuse yet.

18
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:37,460
♪ I don't expect anyone to stay ♪

19
00:01:36,650 --> 00:01:40,820
[Microphone: ON][Speaker: ON][Camera: ON]

20
00:01:37,479 --> 00:01:38,880
Can you turn on the light?

21
00:01:39,270 --> 00:01:43,120
♪ Then I met you, in this moment ♪

22
00:01:39,509 --> 00:01:40,600
I want to see you.

23
00:01:43,210 --> 00:01:46,270
♪ Like drifting into a dream ♪

24
00:01:46,289 --> 00:01:50,250
[Microphone: ON][Speaker: ON][Camera: ON]

25
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:52,180
♪ In the dream, stars carry a boat
toward the shore ♪

26
00:01:52,690 --> 00:01:55,700
♪ Your faint light lingers ♪

27
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,000
I'll come back next week.

28
00:01:56,009 --> 00:02:00,070
♪ Spreading a warm current
through my heart ♪

29
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:59,009
Is there anything you need me to bring?

30
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:02,540
♪ Our eyes meet ♪

31
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:01,800
I heard from Lawyer Zhang

32
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,210
that you're not coming back until
the end of the month.

33
00:02:03,210 --> 00:02:06,500
♪ Bit by bit, healing the wounds ♪

34
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,210
I've finished my business.

35
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,180
I want to go back early.

36
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:11,000
♪ I fear when the dream ends ♪

37
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:09,919
[Miss Shu.]

38
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,120
[The imported medication your mother
recently switched to]

39
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:14,950
♪ I'll have to let go of that tenderness ♪

40
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,360
[is very expensive.]

41
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,840
[If you can find a way]

42
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:17,060
[Microphone: ON][Speaker: ON][Camera: ON]

43
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,120
[to get the medication
directly from overseas,]

44
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:18,380
♪ I need a mouthful of excuses ♪

45
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,770
[your financial burden will be lighter.]

46
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,280
I don't need anything.

47
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:24,440
♪ Just to fool myself about
the years I loved you ♪

48
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,300
Don't trouble.

49
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:26,370
Mr. Zhuo.

50
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:28,640
The online meeting is about to start.

51
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,040
Got it.

52
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:34,860
[Microphone: ON][Speaker: ON][Camera: ON]

53
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,590
You should get back to work.

54
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:35,250
I need to get ready for bed too.

55
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:35,920
Okay.

56
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,100
Good night.

57
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:39,700
[Microphone: ON][Speaker: ON][Camera: ON]

58
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:40,350
♪ Remembering yesterday's dream ♪

59
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:44,170
♪ Coming and going too hastily ♪

60
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:49,570
♪ Forgive me for doubting
the story is the same ♪

61
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:53,260
[Bill]

62
00:02:52,110 --> 00:02:54,430
♪ Along this journey ♪

63
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:58,079
♪ High mountains, steep
roads—there will be pain ♪

64
00:02:58,650 --> 00:03:04,030
♪ Lingering in a hazy embrace ♪

65
00:03:05,130 --> 00:03:09,080
♪ The clock of fate turns once ♪

66
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:12,370
♪ Opening that dream ♪

67
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:14,560
[One week later]

68
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,640
♪ You stand behind me ♪

69
00:03:14,610 --> 00:03:21,770
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

70
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:21,780
♪ As if blessed by the divine ♪

71
00:03:22,250 --> 00:03:25,200
♪ Holding my hand ♪

72
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:29,530
♪ Gripping the future, no
longer trembling ♪

73
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,220
♪ Spring goes, autumn returns ♪

74
00:03:32,970 --> 00:03:36,340
♪ You said you'd stay with me to the end ♪

75
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:40,900
♪ Perhaps the wild waves
will never cease ♪

76
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:38,650
[Haining West Station]
[Yong An Guo Fu Building]

77
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:40,110
[Haining West Station]

78
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:44,320
♪ The story's ending has
finished playing ♪

79
00:03:44,540 --> 00:03:46,740
[Finding a car]

80
00:03:45,010 --> 00:03:48,090
♪ We're by each other's side ♪

81
00:03:48,579 --> 00:03:53,900
♪ Walking through the long, long years ♪

82
00:03:54,010 --> 00:03:57,490
♪ I once hesitated whether I could stay ♪

83
00:03:57,570 --> 00:03:59,640
♪ Stay in your tenderness ♪

84
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:00,440
Long time no see

85
00:04:00,330 --> 00:04:02,390
♪ Your steadfast eyes ♪

86
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,360
Mr Zhuo.

87
00:04:03,050 --> 00:04:09,410
♪ Make me stop looking for excuses ♪

88
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:04,060
Long time no see.

89
00:04:05,490 --> 00:04:06,560
Let me drive you.

90
00:04:07,380 --> 00:04:08,080
No need.

91
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:09,760
I've called a taxi.

92
00:04:11,210 --> 00:04:12,880
♪ Holding your hand ♪

93
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:12,520
Three minutes

94
00:04:13,830 --> 00:04:17,510
♪ Crossing the night to greet the day ♪

95
00:04:14,590 --> 00:04:15,120
Oh.

96
00:04:16,279 --> 00:04:17,610
Then I'll walk with you.

97
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:20,220
♪ Leaning in your arms ♪

98
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,510
♪ Light illuminates every
corner of gloom ♪

99
00:04:22,830 --> 00:04:29,490
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

100
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:28,930
♪ The vast sky after the rain clears ♪

101
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:32,930
♪ After the storm, sprouts
grow into a rainbow ♪

102
00:04:33,420 --> 00:04:36,100
♪ No reason needed ♪

103
00:04:36,990 --> 00:04:44,400
♪ I just want to love you
without holding back ♪

104
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,060
It's rush hour.

105
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:38,909
And it's snowing.

106
00:04:38,909 --> 00:04:39,909
Hard to get a taxi.

107
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,000
Or—

108
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:45,560
Take the umbrella.

109
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,200
I'll walk.

110
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,260
Then I'll trouble you—

111
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:58,180
to walk me to the bus stop up ahead.

112
00:04:58,230 --> 00:05:04,300
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

113
00:05:24,210 --> 00:05:25,540
I prepared this for you.

114
00:05:26,770 --> 00:05:27,600
Thank you.

115
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,940
Are you getting off work at
this time tomorrow too?

116
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:52,800
Yes.

117
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:08,240
Just drop me off up ahead.

118
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,170
Thank you, Mr. Zhuo.

119
00:06:29,930 --> 00:06:30,840
Shu Tinglan.

120
00:06:37,710 --> 00:06:38,840
It's still snowing.

121
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,320
Use the umbrella.

122
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,360
Thank you.

123
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:38,120
Mr. Zhuo.

124
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,120
Please take a look at this document.

125
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,260
Lawyer Shu.

126
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,380
Meeting's starting.

127
00:07:56,490 --> 00:07:56,920
Okay.

128
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:58,070
I'll be right there.

129
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,640
Zhuoyuan Technology is planning

130
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:07,440
to acquire Shengpurui Company next.

131
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,240
For due diligence,

132
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,300
we need you on site.

133
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,440
No problem.

134
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,640
I've already reviewed

135
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:13,240
Shengpurui's information.

136
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:15,120
Right, Lawyer Zhang.

137
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,290
Tinglan happens to be from Qining.

138
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,480
It's perfect for her to go to

139
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,740
the OEM factory there for due diligence.

140
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,600
Going to Qining?

141
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:23,960
Yes, right.

142
00:08:24,510 --> 00:08:26,440
Shengpurui has

143
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,040
an important OEM factory in Qining.

144
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:29,240
We need you to investigate

145
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,480
their land assets

146
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,320
and employee equity issues.

147
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,659
Is there some inconvenience?

148
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,860
I can send Jiajia instead.

149
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:40,480
No.

150
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:41,679
I can do it.

151
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:55,020
[Qining City]

152
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,960
Then may I ask when I can

153
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:56,960
meet the factory manager to have a chat?

154
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,200
One moment, let me ask.

155
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:58,640
Mm.

156
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:07,920
Hey, excuse me, let me through.

157
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:08,560
Excuse me.

158
00:09:09,050 --> 00:09:09,880
Here.

159
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,400
Hey, have you two heard?

160
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,170
What?

161
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,720
The headquarters

162
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,760
sold the factory.

163
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:16,860
What?

164
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,030
They sell it just like that?

165
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:20,000
So we workers can go eat nothing?

166
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,000
Yeah, right.

167
00:09:21,590 --> 00:09:22,540
The factory is in Qining.

168
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:23,820
Out here no one’s watching.

169
00:09:23,690 --> 00:09:26,430
[Back to Qining City]

170
00:09:23,850 --> 00:09:25,680
The headquarters doesn't
get to boss us around.

171
00:09:25,680 --> 00:09:26,680
Come on.

172
00:09:26,770 --> 00:09:28,100
Anyway, no matter what,

173
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,530
if our wages are cut,

174
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:30,400
we'll make trouble.

175
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,330
Come on.
Come on.

176
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,240
Lawyer Shu.

177
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,640
The boss says some things
about the factory

178
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:42,640
can't be discussed internally.

179
00:09:42,640 --> 00:09:44,900
Please come to Qingyun Teahouse to talk.

180
00:09:45,780 --> 00:09:47,430
[Qingyun Tea House]

181
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:57,720
Lawyer Shu, right?

182
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,200
Yes.

183
00:09:58,220 --> 00:09:59,160
Sorry to keep you waiting.

184
00:09:59,160 --> 00:09:59,820
Please sit.

185
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:03,720
I know you're busy.

186
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,240
So I'll get straight to the point.

187
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:05,960
This time,

188
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,560
I'm here on behalf of Zhuoyuan Technology

189
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:09,920
to look into the factory
employees' equity structure

190
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,480
and their willingness to transfer shares

191
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,160
once the factory is sold.

192
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,000
To be honest, Lawyer Shu,

193
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,040
our factory’s a bit

194
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,400
of a special case.

195
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:19,520
The union

196
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,900
worked hard to secure

197
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:23,500
the opportunity for employees
to hold equity.

198
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:24,560
So

199
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:26,560
regarding the employees' equity,

200
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:28,800
no matter who the buyers are,

201
00:10:29,110 --> 00:10:30,160
we won't sell.

202
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:32,800
Okay.

203
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,570
Understood.

204
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:34,880
I'll relay

205
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,460
your message accurately.

206
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,600
Lawyer Shu.

207
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:40,020
Please have some tea.

208
00:10:40,020 --> 00:10:40,620
Thank you.

209
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:42,080
I've got work to do.

210
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,280
Well…
I heard that...

211
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,160
Lawyer Shu

212
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:45,580
is also from Qining.

213
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,220
Yes.

214
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,850
I don't mean anything else.

215
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,040
It's just that the owner of this teahouse,

216
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:52,800
Xu Tao,

217
00:10:53,470 --> 00:10:56,000
seems to be an old acquaintance
of your father.

218
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,000
He specifically asked me

219
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,800
to make sure to invite you here,

220
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,670
saying

221
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,320
he wants to catch up with you.

222
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,400
There may be some misunderstanding.

223
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,660
I don't know any Xu Tao.

224
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,080
I'll be going now.

225
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:22,760
What's going on?

226
00:11:23,170 --> 00:11:24,570
Why are you backing away?

227
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:25,920
Lanlan.

228
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,160
You don't recognize me anymore?

229
00:11:36,170 --> 00:11:38,960
[Certificate]

230
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:44,160
Lanlan.

231
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:45,960
Remember,

232
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,300
no matter what happens outside,

233
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:47,880
don't come out.

234
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:48,560
Don't make a sound.

235
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:49,560
Stay here, okay?

236
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,400
Mom!

237
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:54,560
Let go!

238
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:56,730
Sister-in-law.

239
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,520
You're getting prettier and prettier.

240
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,200
Xu Tao.

241
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:03,760
Search your conscience.

242
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:04,960
Did the factory end up like this

243
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,310
have nothing to do with you?

244
00:12:06,310 --> 00:12:06,960
Huh?

245
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,820
What does it have to do with me?

246
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,520
It’s all written down in the contract,

247
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:15,180
all in your name, Shu Minghai.

248
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:16,660
How about this—

249
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:17,680
you sign this,

250
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:20,940
and we'll let bygones be bygones
about the factory.

251
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:21,860
You're insane.

252
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:22,960
With interest that high,

253
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:24,000
I could never sign.

254
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:24,760
No?

255
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:25,800
Fine.

256
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,080
Then let's see

257
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,560
how my brothers handle this.

258
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:29,280
Pay up!

259
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,210
Heartless boss!

260
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:31,800
Heartless boss!

261
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:32,480
Pay up!

262
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:36,600
Come out!

263
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:37,880
Hurry up and pay!

264
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,280
Pay up!

265
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,640
Get out here and pay!

266
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,680
Heartless boss!
